nt_statement_sha256":"sha256:8df119063fca7f262aa92d769479bb928bc2bacf13c540b35fc78a55db34fbc3","file":"preprints/Entropy-equality-and-local-symmetry-in-negative-curvature-September-23-2026/build/main.tex","line":89,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"fc1ea68065f02b3fc1d97f9ddc775af01cc6ba54fcb3490bc8dd13a25835c676","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Entropy-equality-and-local-symmetry-in-negative-curvature-September-23-2026/build/main.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:8df119063fca7f262aa92d769479bb928bc2bacf13c540b35fc78a55db34fbc3","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Entropy-equality-and-local-symmetry-in-negative-curvature-September-23-2026/build/main.tex#L89"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nSuppose $n\\ge3$ and every sectional curvature of $g$ is strictly\nnegative. Then\n\\[\n h_{m_L}(\\phi_1)=\\htop(\\phi_1)\n \\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n \\nabla^gR_g=0.\n\\]\nEquivalently, equality holds precisely when the universal Riemannian\ncover is a rank-one symmetric space of noncompact type, at an arbitrary\noverall scale."}
